<title>飞机着陆｜匀减速直线运动可视化</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#eef2f8;
    --ink:#0f172a;
    --muted:#64748b;
    --line:#dbe3ee;
    --blue:#2563eb;
    --blue-soft:#dbeafe;
    --orange:#f59e0b;
    --green:#10b981;
    --red:#ef4444;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;}
  body{
